WEBVTT

00:25.741 --> 00:30.078
FOOL NIGHT

01:48.281 --> 01:49.115
Mukuru…

01:49.616 --> 01:50.575
<i>Move over!</i>

01:51.117 --> 01:53.495
<i>She forced my sister into transfloration!</i>

01:53.578 --> 01:55.038
<i>I won't rest until I get revenge!</i>

01:55.122 --> 01:59.126
<i>I'm gonna kill, kill, kill,</i>
<i>and then rip her to shreds!</i>

01:59.209 --> 02:00.877
<i>I'll obliterate her!</i>

02:00.961 --> 02:03.255
Stop already. Yomiko regrets it.

02:04.131 --> 02:07.050
This whole time,
she's been thinking about Shiika Izumi,

02:07.134 --> 02:10.804
what she could've done,
and how to earn your forgiveness.

02:10.887 --> 02:13.014
Hasn't she atoned enough?

02:13.640 --> 02:15.433
<i>What does "atone" mean?</i>

02:17.477 --> 02:19.688
It means profusely apologizing

02:19.771 --> 02:21.606
to earn your forgiveness.

02:22.566 --> 02:24.526
<i>What's the point of saying all this?</i>

02:25.235 --> 02:26.653
<i>Apologize?</i>

02:26.736 --> 02:29.739
<i>If you wanna apologize,</i>
<i>jump off and die already!</i>

02:30.240 --> 02:31.074
No!

02:31.741 --> 02:33.827
That won't accomplish anything.

02:34.452 --> 02:36.037
Revenge is pointless…

02:36.746 --> 02:39.541
<i>Empty apologies</i>
<i>won't accomplish anything either!</i>

02:39.624 --> 02:42.878
<i>I can't allow this person</i>
<i>to live one second longer!</i>

02:45.630 --> 02:47.424
If you kill Yomiko,

02:47.507 --> 02:48.884
I'll kill you.

02:49.759 --> 02:52.846
Forget what I said
about revenge being pointless.

02:53.597 --> 02:55.557
If Yomiko had died back then,

02:55.640 --> 02:58.393
I would've hunted you down
and killed you too.

02:58.476 --> 03:00.729
<i>- Then…</i>
- Yomiko saved me!

03:01.980 --> 03:02.898
I'm the same as you.

03:03.982 --> 03:07.861
I was born into a life of misery.
Not a single good thing happened.

03:09.029 --> 03:11.281
She saved me, and I'm indebted to her!

03:12.616 --> 03:15.452
Even if she's a murderer,
I won't let her die!

03:19.039 --> 03:20.415
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

03:21.291 --> 03:23.001
<i>You're nothing like me!</i>

03:23.084 --> 03:24.419
<i>That's ridiculous!</i>

03:24.920 --> 03:25.837
Mukuru.

03:26.338 --> 03:28.798
I went to Paupertown myself

03:28.882 --> 03:31.676
and saw what you lived through.

03:32.552 --> 03:33.553
<i>So what?</i>

03:36.348 --> 03:39.059
<i>That doesn't mean you understand me!</i>

03:40.477 --> 03:42.562
But I do understand you.

03:46.983 --> 03:49.653
Just like how Yomiko saved me,

03:50.195 --> 03:52.906
I want you to be saved too.

04:19.140 --> 04:21.101
Look what I found, Big Bro!

04:21.810 --> 04:23.603
Another candy wrapper.

04:23.687 --> 04:26.439
Take this seriously, Shiika.

04:26.523 --> 04:29.234
Find a doorknob, or a wire, or something.

04:29.317 --> 04:32.112
If it's not hard and cold, it won't sell.

04:32.195 --> 04:36.324
<i>This memory belongs to Ivy… Mukuru Izumi.</i>

04:37.575 --> 04:39.744
<i>Can I read memories now, too?</i>

04:44.332 --> 04:45.625
Big Bro!

04:47.460 --> 04:48.545
Look.

04:48.628 --> 04:51.381
You found one with candy inside?

04:51.464 --> 04:53.383
No, I just put snow in it.

04:53.967 --> 04:55.719
Come on.

05:01.182 --> 05:03.560
But it tastes kind of sweet.

05:10.025 --> 05:11.693
HOSPITAL

05:12.277 --> 05:13.320
She caught a cold.

05:14.404 --> 05:16.614
Slight malnutrition with diarrhea as well.

05:17.198 --> 05:21.202
Exposure to other viruses or germs
will only make it worse,

05:21.286 --> 05:22.203
so be careful.

05:22.287 --> 05:25.081
"Viruses" or "germs"?

05:25.165 --> 05:29.252
Doctor, about the money for this…

05:34.090 --> 05:35.842
Today, I'll give you a freebie.

05:36.551 --> 05:39.220
<i>Three days' worth</i>
<i>of fever medicine and antibiotics.</i>

05:46.436 --> 05:51.107
Shiika, I'm sorry for always
making you suffer through this.

05:55.111 --> 05:55.987
MUKURU & SHIIKA IZUMI

05:56.071 --> 05:56.905
I'm home.

05:57.614 --> 06:01.117
Hey! I told you to sleep
while you're still sick.

06:02.869 --> 06:05.705
You're making candy out of snow again.

06:05.789 --> 06:09.000
Look, look, I made all of these.

06:09.584 --> 06:11.795
They look real.

06:15.006 --> 06:16.758
Did you find that book today?

06:16.841 --> 06:19.385
I picked it up
while gathering scrap metal.

06:19.469 --> 06:22.180
<i>"Introduction to Architectural Design."</i>

06:23.056 --> 06:24.349
Can you read that?

06:25.225 --> 06:27.560
I can read it. Maybe.

06:27.644 --> 06:29.187
It's not too hard?

06:36.903 --> 06:39.864
Identical symbols on page 16…

06:39.948 --> 06:40.990
STRUCTURE

06:41.074 --> 06:42.784
Maybe it's a person's name…

06:46.121 --> 06:48.289
SIMILAR TO THE LETTER "K"

06:49.707 --> 06:51.334
All kinds of symbols…

06:53.837 --> 06:55.046
You okay?

07:17.402 --> 07:20.238
<i>Something's wrong.</i>
<i>This isn't normal work exhaustion.</i>

07:21.281 --> 07:22.490
<i>It's oxygen deficiency.</i>

07:23.074 --> 07:24.159
<i>Didn't even notice.</i>

07:24.242 --> 07:26.286
<i>There's not a single Spiriflor in sight!</i>

07:33.626 --> 07:34.836
Hey!

07:35.795 --> 07:37.464
Are you okay?

07:47.140 --> 07:48.725
Hypoxic encephalopathy.

07:50.018 --> 07:52.437
What? What does that mean?

07:53.021 --> 07:55.064
Why won't my body move right?

07:55.148 --> 07:56.107
As the name suggests,

07:56.941 --> 07:59.736
you went too long
without sufficient oxygen in the brain,

08:00.653 --> 08:03.490
which resulted in brain damage
and paralysis in the limbs.

08:03.573 --> 08:06.868
Bring extra oxygen masks
when you gather scrap metal!

08:06.951 --> 08:08.536
You should know better!

08:10.622 --> 08:12.707
What's "oxygen"?

08:14.501 --> 08:16.628
Are you talking about the air?

08:17.545 --> 08:19.756
There's air everywhere, right?

08:20.340 --> 08:21.508
"Oxygen" means--

08:21.591 --> 08:23.343
This is too confusing!

08:23.426 --> 08:26.304
What do you mean, "brain damage"?

08:26.387 --> 08:28.723
Why won't my body move?

08:28.806 --> 08:30.767
When's it gonna get better?

08:31.893 --> 08:34.938
It's difficult to treat
with our current technology.

08:35.605 --> 08:36.606
Why?

08:36.689 --> 08:40.109
Why don't we just
get rid of all this "virus" stuff?

08:40.193 --> 08:41.611
Watch out!

08:42.946 --> 08:46.658
Help me get better, quick…

08:49.035 --> 08:52.497
I have to raise money to support Shiika!

08:53.206 --> 08:57.293
I understand how shocking
this must be, but I can't heal you.

08:57.377 --> 08:59.754
Part of your brain isn't functioning.

09:00.505 --> 09:04.092
Without these tiny particles
called "oxygen" in the air,

09:04.175 --> 09:05.718
humans can't breathe.

09:07.595 --> 09:10.598
You just didn't have the knowledge…

09:13.851 --> 09:15.937
Knowledge and imagination.

09:17.188 --> 09:20.733
Knowledge and imagination
will keep misfortune away

09:22.068 --> 09:23.903
and enrich our lives.

09:25.905 --> 09:29.033
With stuff like knowledge and imagination,

09:29.742 --> 09:33.413
how did everybody else get those things?

09:33.496 --> 09:35.540
Did they have 'em before they were born?

09:39.627 --> 09:42.672
Shiika, you gotta eat something.

09:42.755 --> 09:44.173
I don't feel good…

09:44.257 --> 09:45.675
To heal, you gotta eat…

10:01.399 --> 10:04.235
Let's go buy candy
when your cold goes away.

10:07.280 --> 10:09.198
That'll be your reward.

10:10.033 --> 10:11.576
So try your best to eat.

10:14.621 --> 10:19.000
I hope we can find some cute ones…

10:21.377 --> 10:25.506
I wonder what flavor it'll be…

10:30.303 --> 10:32.847
What? Who are you people?

10:34.599 --> 10:37.018
Shiika! Shiika!

10:37.769 --> 10:39.854
Stop! Put me down!

10:39.937 --> 10:41.606
Quit squirming!

10:42.815 --> 10:44.192
C'mon…

10:51.658 --> 10:53.576
That hurt! Damn brat!

10:55.161 --> 10:56.037
Why, you!

10:56.120 --> 10:59.207
Forget it.
The boy won't sell for much anyway.

11:00.792 --> 11:02.168
Shiika…

11:06.130 --> 11:07.048
Wait!

11:07.632 --> 11:09.008
Don't take her away!

11:09.634 --> 11:11.719
Run away, Shiika!

11:11.803 --> 11:13.471
Fight them off and run!

11:28.986 --> 11:29.987
Big Bro--

12:02.270 --> 12:03.896
Hello there.

12:04.814 --> 12:07.525
<i>This guy is Dr. Kudai!</i>

12:08.109 --> 12:12.655
I know it's a sudden request,
but would you let me experiment on you?

12:12.738 --> 12:15.116
I want more soul, more life energy.

12:15.199 --> 12:18.202
Working with lab rats isn't enough.

12:18.995 --> 12:21.289
So, I'd like to experiment with humans.

12:21.914 --> 12:23.291
Basically,

12:23.374 --> 12:27.295
if you let me perform this procedure
and turn you into a plant,

12:27.378 --> 12:29.380
I'll make your body mobile again.

12:29.464 --> 12:32.425
And I'll do what I can
to satisfy any other desires you have.

12:35.178 --> 12:36.471
What do you say?

12:46.814 --> 12:48.774
My little sister.

12:49.775 --> 12:51.903
Please find Shiika for me.

12:52.612 --> 12:54.655
You've got yourself a deal!

12:54.739 --> 12:56.699
Congrats! And thank you!

12:56.782 --> 12:59.160
Nice to meet you, Specimen No. 5!

12:59.243 --> 13:01.412
SHIIKA

13:03.456 --> 13:04.290
You're lying…

13:05.416 --> 13:08.586
Make no mistake, it's your little sister.

13:29.857 --> 13:31.859
<i>Why are you crying all of a sudden?</i>

13:33.027 --> 13:38.074
All the memories and grief
from your life in Paupertown

13:38.741 --> 13:40.409
just flooded into me…

13:40.493 --> 13:41.536
<i>What do you mean?</i>

13:41.619 --> 13:42.787
I saw it.

13:43.788 --> 13:46.707
Shiika undergoing transfloration
and getting reaped.

13:47.625 --> 13:48.709
I saw all your pain!

13:48.793 --> 13:50.336
<i>Don't lie to me!</i>

13:50.419 --> 13:52.213
It's true! Believe me…

13:52.296 --> 13:55.841
<i>If you're going to make fun of us,</i>
<i>I won't forgive you either!</i>

13:57.343 --> 13:58.427
Mukuru…

14:01.222 --> 14:03.057
You can't eat snow.

14:06.102 --> 14:07.603
The snow in Paupertown is poisonous.

14:08.604 --> 14:11.482
It's got 100-year-old germs and filth.

14:12.858 --> 14:14.735
<i>How do you know about our snow candy?</i>

14:16.571 --> 14:17.989
<i>The snow was poisonous?</i>

14:18.072 --> 14:20.366
<i>The whole time, Shiika was eating poison?</i>

14:20.449 --> 14:22.493
Sorry! I should've kept quiet
about the snow.

14:23.160 --> 14:25.037
I just wanted you to believe me--

14:25.121 --> 14:26.956
<i>I didn't stop her.</i>

14:27.874 --> 14:30.585
<i>Yet another thing I didn't know.</i>

14:30.668 --> 14:31.586
<i>It's my fault…</i>

14:31.669 --> 14:32.920
Don't blame yourself.

14:33.629 --> 14:36.090
You didn't know.
There's nothing you could've done!

14:37.091 --> 14:41.512
At birth, everyone starts at zero.
They don't know anything.

14:41.596 --> 14:45.516
Somebody's gotta teach them
how to climb up from zero.

14:46.601 --> 14:49.854
In your case, Mukuru,
nobody was there to teach you.

14:52.189 --> 14:55.276
We can share that pain,
frustration, and anger

14:57.278 --> 14:58.446
right now.

15:05.411 --> 15:06.871
<i>Mister…</i>

15:07.538 --> 15:10.333
<i>Will I ever be happy?</i>

15:13.377 --> 15:14.795
No, you can't be.

15:15.504 --> 15:17.673
You killed tons of people.

15:17.757 --> 15:19.550
You need to face the consequences.

15:19.634 --> 15:21.802
<i>What are you holding?</i>

15:21.886 --> 15:24.555
<i>Stop. I have an awful feeling about this.</i>

15:24.639 --> 15:26.933
- Ivy!
<i>- Please, don't do anything to me.</i>

15:27.642 --> 15:28.601
<i>Be my…</i>

15:29.226 --> 15:31.228
<i>Just be my friend!</i>

15:37.443 --> 15:39.987
I don't know if you can hear me,

15:40.738 --> 15:45.743
but I made your little sister undergo
transfloration to save my own skin.

15:48.329 --> 15:49.455
I'm sorry.

15:50.206 --> 15:51.332
<i>I won't forgive you.</i>

15:53.167 --> 15:54.502
Sorry, I know it's unfair.

15:55.920 --> 15:57.088
Is that a bomb?

15:57.713 --> 16:00.216
Light it. We'll beeline to the rear car.

16:01.342 --> 16:03.135
We can't condone this child's actions.

16:06.097 --> 16:07.974
<i>Kill. Kill.</i>

16:08.975 --> 16:11.102
Hikasa is gonna kill Dr. Kudai.

16:24.740 --> 16:25.741
Crap.

16:25.825 --> 16:28.369
Crap Crap. Crap!

16:32.832 --> 16:33.666
We have to go.

16:34.250 --> 16:37.003
Let's stop Hikasa and capture Dr. Kudai.

16:49.223 --> 16:54.311
We've reached out several times
in hopes of rebuilding your family.

16:54.937 --> 16:57.523
And you're still abusing your own child?

16:58.899 --> 17:02.028
Humans without love
have no reason to live.

17:05.072 --> 17:06.282
Shine…

17:07.408 --> 17:08.701
Shine down on us…

17:10.578 --> 17:11.829
All of us…

17:13.122 --> 17:15.624
With love… and light…

17:20.337 --> 17:21.589
And you are?

17:23.299 --> 17:25.968
Have you come to kill me too?

17:27.344 --> 17:29.055
Dr. Kudai…

17:34.477 --> 17:36.520
We're employees of Transflora Medical.

17:37.104 --> 17:38.147
Regarding Ivy,

17:38.230 --> 17:42.902
please show us research and seedling data
from Mukuru's late-stage transfloration

17:42.985 --> 17:47.448
along with proof that his development
was aided by the Glory Days Party.

17:48.032 --> 17:49.950
We need you to testify in court.

17:52.244 --> 17:53.662
No.

17:57.833 --> 18:00.002
Nobody's supporting you anymore!

18:00.086 --> 18:01.462
If you provide a testimony,

18:01.545 --> 18:04.465
Transflora Medical
will fund your continued research

18:04.548 --> 18:05.841
even if they arrest you!

18:06.425 --> 18:07.468
Nah.

18:08.511 --> 18:09.720
Please!

18:09.804 --> 18:12.765
Tell them this uproar had nothing to do
with Transflora Medical!

18:12.848 --> 18:15.142
You're utterly clueless.

18:15.226 --> 18:16.936
I choose to protect myself.

18:23.651 --> 18:25.027
Mukuru?

18:26.278 --> 18:27.488
What's the matter?

19:02.022 --> 19:04.775
<i>Before he shoots, I feel tension</i>
<i>and a sense of dominance.</i>

19:05.526 --> 19:06.986
<i>If I can read the timing,</i>

19:08.946 --> 19:09.780
<i>I can dodge!</i>

19:20.374 --> 19:23.377
<i>Right. Left. Up.</i>

19:24.044 --> 19:25.045
<i>Right.</i>

19:25.921 --> 19:26.839
<i>Down.</i>

19:27.339 --> 19:28.174
<i>Left.</i>

19:29.341 --> 19:30.217
<i>Stab!</i>

19:48.736 --> 19:50.404
Toshiro!

20:06.170 --> 20:08.380
<i>Mister…</i>

20:22.770 --> 20:24.188
Thanks for leading the way.

20:48.379 --> 20:50.089
Toshiro! Toshiro!

20:50.172 --> 20:51.590
Toshiro!

20:51.674 --> 20:54.635
Hey, come on! Don't die!

20:54.718 --> 20:56.095
Wake up, Toshiro!

20:56.178 --> 20:57.471
Damn irregular!

20:57.554 --> 20:59.723
No!

21:00.516 --> 21:02.601
Talk to me, Toshiro!

21:02.685 --> 21:05.396
Please! Open your eyes!

21:06.689 --> 21:08.857
Did he sprout this root?

21:10.943 --> 21:13.445
It'd be a waste to let him die!

21:14.071 --> 21:15.739
Carry him over there.

21:18.075 --> 21:19.410
What are you doing?

21:19.994 --> 21:22.621
If you're from Transflora Medical,
you'd better help me.

21:45.602 --> 21:46.645
<i>Am I dead?</i>

21:47.229 --> 21:49.523
<i>No way. I wasn't even ready.</i>

21:49.606 --> 21:52.818
<i>I didn't say goodbye</i>
<i>to Yomiko, Mom, or anybody.</i>

21:56.822 --> 21:58.324
<i>What was that?</i>

22:07.041 --> 22:09.460
<i>Crockley Street, banana smoothie.</i>

22:09.543 --> 22:11.462
<i>Hey, I don't get this homework.</i>

22:12.546 --> 22:13.380
<i>3 times 3 is 9…</i>

22:13.464 --> 22:15.132
<i>If only I had money…</i>

22:15.215 --> 22:16.800
<i>Hey, I said don't do that!</i>

22:16.884 --> 22:17.968
<i>Cut it out.</i>

22:19.178 --> 22:21.430
<i>Way too much information…</i>

22:21.513 --> 22:22.973
<i>Flowing into my head at once…</i>

22:23.057 --> 22:24.224
<i>Cut me some slack…</i>

22:27.561 --> 22:30.606
<i>This isn't the afterlife.</i>

22:31.607 --> 22:35.903
<i>It's a flowery meadow where everyone's</i>
<i>memories and emotions breathe.</i>

22:35.986 --> 22:36.904
Mister!

22:41.658 --> 22:43.077
Hey, mister!

22:45.412 --> 22:47.748
Hey, this place is awesome!

22:47.831 --> 22:49.708
I know what they're all thinking.

22:49.792 --> 22:52.044
I can read everyone's emotions!

22:52.795 --> 22:54.046
Mukuru.

22:56.548 --> 23:00.385
My head's buzzing.
It's making me want to build something!

23:10.437 --> 23:12.564
<i>Knowledge and imagination.</i>

23:13.941 --> 23:17.611
Knowledge and imagination
will keep misfortune away

23:20.948 --> 23:23.158
and enrich our lives.

23:29.581 --> 23:30.582
<i>Sorry, Shiika.</i>

23:31.208 --> 23:33.001
<i>Sorry, I'm the only one having fun.</i>

23:34.670 --> 23:37.089
<i>I'm glad I was born after all!</i>

25:16.897 --> 25:21.902
Subtitle translation by: Logan Lampkins
